---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import mascotHead from "../assets/images/MASCOTA HEAD.png";
---

<section
  id="finno"
  class="relative py-28 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-dark text-white overflow-hidden"
>
  <!-- Layered branded background -->
  <div
    class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-secondary/40 via-dark to-dark pointer-events-none"
  >
  </div>
  <div
    class="absolute -top-20 -left-20 w-96 h-96 bg-primary/30 rounded-full blur-3xl animate-float-slower pointer-events-none"
  >
  </div>
  <div
    class="absolute -bottom-24 -right-20 w-96 h-96 bg-accent/30 rounded-full blur-3xl animate-float-slow pointer-events-none"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center relative z-10">
    <div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
      <div
        class="relative bg-secondary/40 p-4 rounded-full border border-primary/40 shadow-brand-glow reveal-scale"
      >
        <span
          class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full animate-pulse-ring"
          aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <Image
          src={mascotHead}
          alt="Finno Mascot"
          class="relative w-24 h-24 object-contain animate-float-slow"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="inline-block mb-4 px-3 py-1 bg-secondary/60 rounded-full text-primary-200 text-sm font-semibold border border-primary/40 reveal delay-100"
    >
      ✨ Potenciado por Inteligencia Artificial
    </div>
    <h2
      class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6 text-gradient-brand reveal delay-200"
    >
      Conoce a FINNO
    </h2>
    <p
      class="text-xl text-slate-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 reveal delay-300"
    >
      Tu asistente personal inteligente. Haz preguntas, recibe consejos
      personalizados y optimiza tus gastos con una IA que aprende de tus hábitos
      financieros.
    </p>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-center lg:text-left">
      <div
        class="group bg-white/5 backdrop-blur p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:border-primary/60 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-brand-glow transition-all duration-300 reveal delay-400"
      >
        <div
          class="text-4xl mb-4 inline-flex w-14 h-14 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/20 group-hover:bg-primary/30 transition"
        >
          💬
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-white">Chat Financiero</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300/90">
          Habla naturalmente con FINNO sobre tus dudas. "¿Cuánto gasté en café
          este mes?" o "¿Cómo puedo ahorrar para un viaje?".
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="group bg-white/5 backdrop-blur p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:border-accent/60 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-accent-glow transition-all duration-300 reveal delay-500"
      >
        <div
          class="text-4xl mb-4 inline-flex w-14 h-14 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-accent/20 group-hover:bg-accent/30 transition"
        >
          💡
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-white">Tips Inteligentes</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300/90">
          Recibe recomendaciones proactivas basadas en tus patrones de gasto
          para mejorar tu salud financiera día a día.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="group bg-white/5 backdrop-blur p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:border-primary/60 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-brand-glow transition-all duration-300 reveal delay-700"
      >
        <div
          class="text-4xl mb-4 inline-flex w-14 h-14 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/20 group-hover:bg-primary/30 transition"
        >
          📊
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-white">Análisis Profundo</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300/90">
          FINNO analiza tus datos para encontrar oportunidades de ahorro que
          quizás pasaste por alto.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
